<div style="padding-left:20px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:15px;padding-top:15px;font-size:13px;color:#000" id=integrator>
<h2>Our Story</h2>
<p>
OnWorks is a free online VPS hosting provider that gives cloud services like free workstations, online AntiVirus, free VPN secure proxies, and free personal and business email. </p>
<p>It uses a website and apps providing free workstations that can be based on a lot of kind of Operative Systems like CentOS, Fedora, Ubuntu and Debian. OnWorks is a multi-device platform so that our customers can run and test any type of OS from everywhere. It is simple, full of features, light and easy to use by our end users. OnWorks is your cloud computing provider where you can enjoy a lot of type of workstations, and run them free of charge:
</p>
<ul>
<li>
* The workstations are pre-installed with SW for Office, Graphics, Videos, Games and so on.
</li>
<li>
* They can be customized with more SW by each user.
</li>
<li>
* It is integrated with Google Drive to save and retrieve OS sessions.
</li>
<li>
* It has apps to run Linux and other operative systems in IOS devices, Android phones, extension for Chrome Store, and web app.
</li>
</ul>
<p>
Moreover OnWorks provides more IT tools in order to provide a more secure and completed VPS user experience:
<ul>
<li>
* An Antivirus online so that our end users can scan online any file that will be run in Windows and Linux systems. This antivirus is based on ClamAV online.
</li>
<li>
* A free VPN (VPNOnline) to unlock sites and stay secure, take care of your Internet privacy. This is our solution for private browsing, change your location, and get protection from malicious websites.
</li>
<li>
* A free email platform so that you can provision and use free personal email and free business email.
</li>
</ul>
</p>
<p>
Providing all these tools, OnWorks gives a new meaning to the way we discover, develop, install and use any software and any Operative System.
</p>
<p>
OnWorks was founded in 2019 and has grown into one of the leading websites in the software industry for Linux workstations and free hosting providers.
OnWorks uses Cloudflare CDN and Hetzner services.
</p>
<br>
<h2>Our Company</h2>
<p>
OnWorks is managed by a Private limited company based in Estonia. <br>Address: Harju maakond, Tallinn, Kesklinna linnaosa, Viru väljak 2, 10111. <br> Registry code: 1609791.<br>VAT number: EE102345621.
</p>
<p>
Call us at <a href="tel:+3728804704">+372 8804704</a>
</p>
<div>
<iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2028.7330801763028!2d24.751846416076663!3d59.437526181696875!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x46929360fe8e7cf3%3A0x7b7960fc74b80852!2sViru%20v%C3%A4ljak%202%2C%2010111%20Tallinn%2C%20Estonia!5e0!3m2!1sen!2ses!4v1647011854265!5m2!1sen!2ses" width=600 height=450 style=border:0 allowfullscreen="" loading=lazy></iframe>
</div>
<br>
<h2>Our Mission</h2>
<p>
Our goal is to create a friendly ecosystem for Linux end users and developers on which all parts have a relevant role. We provide a group of tools to develop Linux apps, and a very safe and fast software download experience for our end users all around the world. We provide one of the most comprehensive collections of Linux Apps. Some of them can even be run online inside our free online workstations. Most of the apps included in our collections are downloadable. We guarantee 100% that all the Software located in OnWorks run perfectly and are totally safe.
</p>
<br>
<h2>Technical issues</h2>
<p>
Look for a solution for your technical issue and ask our Support team for help at info[@]onworks.net
</p>
<br>
